puzzlecad/), copied verbatim from the pinned commit, plus the upstream LICENSE and the
LICENSE-MIT copy. The repository's Java and Python tooling, its test and example models
and the printable puzzle designs under src/main/scad are NOT vendored; those individual
designs are distributed upstream under CC-BY-NC-ND 3.0 and are not used here. All the
catalog objects built from this tree use the MIT library code only.

